   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_19"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty busy, but good.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.89,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I got a D on my last biology test and now I just don't want to study at all.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.46,
   "block": "studying.dlg14",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's a rough feeling. A bad grade can really knock motivation. Do you know what went wrong?",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 1.11,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "studying.dlg14"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Not really. I thought I knew it.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.45,
   "block": "studying.dlg14",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's actually useful. It might mean you were reading and recognising things, but not testing yourself.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 1.06,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "studying.dlg14"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "You fed the fish this morning, didn't you, Jack?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
